 22 % de los contratos junto al límite, mientras que diciembre supone el 24 % de todos sus contratos de servicios y suministros. Los contratos junto al límite se reparten entre 45 adjudicatarios distintos. El contrato [1], de 14.999 euros, se adjudicó en diciembre de 2025.\nQué no pueden demostrar: La concentración de contratos al límite no refleja actos ilícitos. Puede deberse a precios de mercado o necesidades específicas. No implica que se haya partido ningún contrato ni que haya malas prácticas.\nQué se puede revisar: Comprobar si los contratos [1], [2], [3] atienden la misma necesidad. Verificar si el adjudicatario A repite contratos en otros ámbitos. Analizar si los contratos al límite coinciden con presupuestos cerrados o fechas específicas.","en":"What the data shows: Between 2023 and 2025, this body awarded 65 minor contracts for services and supplies above 14,000 and up to 15,000 euros, just under the legal limit. If those amounts were spread as in the band immediately below, 13.0 contracts would be expected. The observed-to-expected ratio is 5.0, with a 95% confidence interval of 3.5 to 7.2. December accounts for 22% of the contracts just under the limit, compared with 24% of all its services and supplies contracts. The awardee with the most contracts just under the limit, called awardee A here, has 4. Contract [1], for 14,999 euros, was awarded in December 2025.\nWhat it cannot show: The concentration of contracts in December does not indicate improper activity. Similar trends could result from seasonal demand or budget cycles. The number of contracts near the limit does not prove wrongdoing, as market prices or fixed budgets may influence amounts.\nWhat can be checked: Check the dates and values of contracts to see if they align with seasonal patterns. Review awardee A’s contracts to determine if they repeat the same need or supplier. Contract [1] shows a near-limit amount in December, which may reflect normal procurement practices.","origen_es":"modelo","origen_en":"modelo","modelo":"Qwen3-4B (Q4_K_M, llama.cpp)","regla":"ss","citas":["kHqrUsxZa5fVGIpKDxgsAQ%3D%3D","ing1iR3H%2FmAXhk1FZxEyvw%3D%3D","UXz2hiYhYWLs%2BnLj3vAg5A%3D%3D"],"generado":"2026-11-15"}}